msgstr "To provide effective protection, Contact Form 7 recommends using <a href=\"%1$s\"><strong>Turnstile</strong></a> (good at blocking bots) and <a href=\"%2$s\"><strong>Akismet</strong></a> (good at blocking human spammers) together."

#: admin/includes/dashboard.php:273
